==English==
{{wikipedia}}
[[Image:Illu endocrine system.png|thumb|An overview of endocrine glands.]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy}} Any of various glands that secrete [[hormone]]s directly into the [[blood]] or [[lymph]] and not through a duct.
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2019|author=[[w:Bill Bryson|Bill Bryson]]|title=The Body: A Guide for Occupants|publisher=Black Swan (2020)|page=166|passage=An '''endocrine gland''' is one that secretes its products directly into the bloodstream.}}

